# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into the browser and are PUBLIC.
# Never put private keys, API keys, or private/paid RPC URLs here.
#
# Contract addresses (Base Sepolia, chain id 84532): the app takes them from shared/addresses.json
# by default, so after a redeploy nothing needs to change here. Leave these overrides unset (or
# empty). Set one only to point the app at a different deployment (for example a local Anvil one).
# A copied .env.local that pins an address will keep using that address after a redeploy, and a
# malformed value shows "not configured" instead of falling back.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ARENA_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POINTS_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REGISTRY_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GAP_MARKET_ADDRESS=
# Optional RPC override (must be a public endpoint); defaults to the public Base Sepolia endpoint.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
# Dashboard demo only: set to 1 to add a button that shows a clearly labeled SIMULATED sample instead of
# chain history. Leave unset for real deployments; sample rows are never mixed with chain rows.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_SAMPLE=
